# Example ReRDMFT input file: water, X2C spinors, MULLER, FULL_OPTIMIZATION with CHOLESKY TRUE
# (the macro-iteration loop on Cholesky vectors, Utils/CholeskyEri.h; Kramers-restricted ADAM
# rotations act on the vectors). Compare water_X2C_full_optimization.inp (dense integrals).
NELEC 10
BASIS water-sto-3g.gbs
X2C TRUE
FUNCTIONAL MULLER
CHOLESKY TRUE
FULL_OPTIMIZATION TRUE

GEOMETRY
O   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
H   0.000000   0.757000   0.586000
H   0.000000  -0.757000   0.586000
END
